        "composition": "Workload measurements provide the context for a learned architecture selector; an episode controller applies its decisions through a coordinated switching protocol. Learning chooses among predefined architectures rather than synthesizing arbitrary ones. Correctness depends on the architectures and switching protocol, while exploration affects performance.",
