                "label": "Qualified complexity",
                "text": "General maintenance uses O(log N + m k²) space and O(k²) amortized time per new point, where k is model order and m the number of equations. O(log N) space and O(1) amortized updates follow when model parameters are fixed; an individual update can touch O(log N) levels.",
