        "composition": "Explicit dependencies identify repeated facts; projection and quotienting move these facts into shared nodes connected to the original entities. Fresh labels/edges make the transformation reversible. Normalization reduces dependency-caused redundancy while respecting target labels and property completeness, but requires meaningful constraints and changes how affected data is updated and queried.",
