                "label": "Cost-model and maintenance limits",
                "text": "The model relates traversal to local neighbor geometry and uses a uniform-direction assumption for its quality bound. Deletion uses bounded reverse-neighbor search, deferred cleanup during later queries, and a graph sweep when pending deleted edges reach 10%; maintenance is not universally immediate constant-time deletion.",
