                "text": "Join-induced update handling restricts propagation to primary-key-to-foreign-key directions with referential integrity. The Meta2 batch experiment needs 9.6 minutes for predicate repair and 21.3 minutes for optimization/local partitioning, before roughly three hours of Hive upload shared with the comparison setup. More general independent index/layout evolution is future work.",
