                "label": "Human and language limits",
                "text": "The study with 18 CS students supplies initial ground-truth examples and allows 50 further labels; median task completion spans 8.6–12.3 minutes. Some hard tasks fail even with perfect labels. The language does not support negation, disjunction, or ternary relationships.",
