                "text": "The cluster has 16 nodes, each with 128 cores and 200 GB usable RAM. Full-replication work-steal-predict is up to 6.6 times faster than the independent-MESSI baseline on Seismic. The 100-versus-800-query comparison shows index-building cost can reverse the preferred replication level.",
