                    "summary": "Screen marginally irrelevant variables and use synthetic vertex tests, graph expansion, and conditional stopping to reduce Markov-blanket search.",
                    "primary_metric_improved": "explanation-generation work",
                    "tradeoffs_or_costs": "Pruning guarantees are conditional on the paper’s probabilistic assumptions; topology-based stopping assumes connected necessary vertices, and finite sampling can change the result."
