                "text": "Forty computing postgraduate students predicted GNN decisions for sampled instances. MUTAG-GCN response accuracy is 0.623 with DAG explanations, 0.552 with XGNN, and 0.462 with Glocal; this measures users predicting the model, not model accuracy or causal truth.",
