                    "summary": "Learn a shared, context-sensitive term-reward model with bandit exploration instead of relying on hand-written rules or isolated entity histories.",
                    "primary_metric_improved": "early retrieval effectiveness and feedback efficiency",
                    "tradeoffs_or_costs": "Exploration losses, simplified term interactions, feature limitations, and dependence on relevance feedback."
