                    "summary": "Cache reusable hierarchical strategy responses and plan the split between reused and newly privatized answers.",
                    "primary_metric_improved": "privacy expenditure for overlapping workloads",
                    "tradeoffs_or_costs": "Noise-aware matrix computation, restricted optimizer search, and workload-dependent reuse."
