        "composition": "AER-AD replaces absolute node identities with edge-relative features: overlap with the destination’s interaction neighborhood and distributions of associations among co-visiting users. Learned stochastic masks select partners and associations for multiple behavioral scenes; convolutional encoders and a recurrent history model predict whether an edge is anomalous. This permits inference for unseen users without node attributes. Anonymous here means identity-independent representation, not a privacy guarantee. Training requires anomaly labels, and the evaluation uses held-out source nodes rather than a chronological split. Retrieving and comparing histories remains a major cost, with truncation or sampling trading context for throughput.",
