                "label": "Measured quality and runtime",
                "text": "IMDB-Large regression takes 13.3 minutes versus 612 for Join-Coreset and 782 for Full, with RMSE 0.998 versus 0.988 and 0.985. Nonconvex-model evidence has no corresponding theoretical gradient guarantee.",
