                    "summary": "Optimize query-plus-validation plans across all templates.",
                    "primary_metric_improved": "redundant joins and repeated grounding-query execution",
                    "tradeoffs_or_costs": "Simpler queries can return many extra rows; validation and containment conditions are essential to correctness."
