                    "summary": "Separate entity indexing from connected-network storage and expose reusable spatial primitives.",
                    "primary_metric_improved": "independent maintenance and locality of network-aware queries",
                    "tradeoffs_or_costs": "Additional indexes and segment mapping are required; geometric uncertainty is simplified in the experiments."
